2 CONT This Conrad Yxkull can't be the father of Anna Conradsdotter Staël von Holstein. The aforementioned Anna was born around 1545, and this Conrad Wolmarsson Yxkull's maternal grandfather, Prince Magnus Vasa of Sweden, was born in 154
2 CONC 2. Anna Conradsdotter Staël von Holstein therefore can't be the great-granddaughter of Magnus Vasa, as the age difference is only three years.
