2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L8RZ-RGS
2 CONT Brief Life History of Gertrud Helena Fabiansdotter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Gertrud Helena Fabiansdotter von Tiesenhausen was born about 1641, in Estonia, her father, Fabian von Tiesenhausen, was 53 and her mother, Gertrud Taube av Karlö, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She had at least 5 sons and 3 daughters with Freiherr Otto von Rehbinder. 
2 CONT Baron Bernhard Otto von Rehbinder 1662–1742
2 CONT Hildegard Elisabeth von Rehbinder 1665–1706
2 CONT Kind Rehbinder 1668–
2 CONT Otto von Rehbinder 1668–
2 CONT Fromhold Johan von Rehbinder 1671–1697
2 CONT Gustav Magnus von Rehbinder 1673–
2 CONT Anna Helena Rehbinder 1674–
2 CONT Dorothia Charlotta Rehbinder 1680–
2 CONT
2 CONT She was buried in Tallinn, Harjumaa, Estonia.
