1 NAME Berndt Johan /Hastfer/
2 GIVN Berndt Johan
2 _MARNM Hastfer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 MAY 1737
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tövsala - Taivassalo
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
