1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L1CC-QFW
2 CONT Brief Life History of Hildegard Elisabeth'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Hildegard Elisabeth von Rehbinder was born on 11 May 1665, her father, Freiherr Otto von Rehbinder, was 25 and her mother, Gertrud Helena Fabiansdotter von Tiesenhausen, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Otto Gustaf von Delwig on 25 February 1688, in Tallinn, Harjumaa, Estonia. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT Margaretha Anna Von Delwig 1689–
2 CONT Otto Reinhold Von Dellwig 1690–1750
2 CONT Wolter Reinhold Von Delwig 1691–
2 CONT Gertrud Helene Von Delwig 1695–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in November 1706, at the age of 41.
