1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Freifrau Wrede had an affair with the Russian General Ivan Troubetzkoy, while he was a prisoner of war following the Battle of Narva.  She gave birth to his illegitimate son Ivan, who took as a surname an abbreviat
2 CONC ed form of his father's name"Betskoy". Ivan Troubetzkoy returned to Russia through a prisoner exchange in 1718 while his son Ivan remained in Sweden to complete his education. 
