2 CONT Fader: [https://www.geni.com/people/Claes-Fleming/6000000013090796408 Fleming, Klas Henriksson] (Far: [https://www.geni.com/people/Henrik-Fleming/6000000009441134474 Fleming, Henrik Henriksson]) d. 1706. Amiralitetskapten.
