2 CONT http://trip-suggest.com/estonia/harjumaa/peningi/
2 CONT
2 CONT Peningi in the region of Harjumaa with it's 195 habitants is a place located in Estonia - some 16 mi (or 26 km) South-East of Tallinn, the country's capital.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.mois.ee/english/harju/peningi.shtml
