2 CONT Peningi Manor
2 CONT
2 CONT Penningby in Kirchspiel St. Johannis, Harrien
2 CONT
2 CONT The manor, established in 1686, was long associated with the von Baranoffs. The Early-Classicist two-storey main building was restored after a fire in 1905 in the same style as before. It has layed in ruins since the 1990s (and cu
2 CONC rrently in private possession).
2 CONT
2 CONT By the historical distribution the manor was in Harju-Jaani Parish in Harjumaa County. By the present administrative distribution it belongs to the Raasiku Municipality in Harjumaa County
