1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He owned the estates of Sall, Koil and Moisama which he inherited from Berendt Johann von Schulmann (1660-1746).  He purchased Tammick from Carl Gustaf von Schulmann (1702-1773) in 1750 for 10,000 silver rubles.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also owned the estates of Loewenwolde, Sipp and Kaltenborn at various times.
2 CONT
2 CONT He inherited the estate Piersal from his sister
2 CONT
2 CONT He also owned a large stone house near the St Nikolai Church in Tallinn.  On Feb 7th 1782 he also bought a garden with apartment and a several buildings near the "Schmiedepforte"
2 CONT
2 CONT He was manngerichtersassessor in 1749, 1756, 1757.  He was hakenrichter in 1762 and 1764
2 CONT
