1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==from The Peerage http://thepeerage.com/p1902.htm#i19020 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Sofie Frederikke Vilhelmine von'Uexkull-Güldenband
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #19020
2 CONT b. 1756, d. 26 November 1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Sofie Frederikke Vilhelmine von'Uexkull-Güldenband was born in 1756.[1]  She was the daughter of Karl Gustav Friedrich Graf von Uexkull-Güldenband.  She married David Wemyss 6th Earl of Wemyss, son of James Wemyss 5th Earl of Wemy
2 CONC ss and Janet Charteris, on 9 September 1776 at Beutal, Switzerland.[1]  She died on 26 November 1777, in childbirth.[2] Her married name became Wemyss.
2 CONT
