1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sünd Hanila kogudus: [https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1240.2.1:19?650,608,482,286,0 Saaga EAA.1240.2.1:19?650,608,482,286,0]
