1 NAME Charlotte Helene /von Paykull/
2 GIVN Charlotte Helene
2 SURN von Paykull
2 _MARNM von Arnold
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 APR 1773
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tallinn (Reval)
3 CTRY Estonia
