2 CONT Otto Reinhold was buried under the floor of the old church in Mouhijärvi 1750 closed to the altar. The church was dismantled 1878 and the rests of the corps were buried in the winecellar in the sacrastian. Unfortunately, the tombs
2 CONC tone was not saved. 
