2 CONT The family [https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delwig_(Adelsgeschlecht '''Delwig'''] or [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Von_Dellwig '''von Dellwig'''] or, as in the Runeberg link above, '''von Dellvig''', '''von Delwig''', even '''Dellw
2 CONC ik''', and in Russian [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B8 Дельвиги] is an ancient Baltic German noble family, which has spread all over the Balticum. This branch here is not the one enno
2 CONC bled in Sweden. 
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
