2 CONT
2 CONT When Gertrud Helene Von Delwig was born on 24 January 1695, in Tallinn, Harjumaa, Estonia, her father, Otto Gustaf von Delwig, was 68 and her mother, Hildegard Elisabeth von Rehbinder, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She had at least 1 son and 3 daughters with Jacob Leonhardt Finne.
